<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>选题背景与核心问题</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>02 · Topic</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 62, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 18 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>核心问题：能否把「课程」作为一等对象，让智能体在真实备考流程中持续可用？</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 340, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', marginTop: 20 }}><Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 108, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>01</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 14 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>课程上下文缺失</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>通用大模型聊天工具不区分课程，每次提问都要从零交代背景。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 108, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>02</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 14 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>资料难以沉淀</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>课件、错题散落在各处，无法形成可复用的复习上下文。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 700, height: 108, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>03</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 14 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>复习缺少闭环</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>复习计划靠手工安排，错题录入、诊断、变式、掌握之间没有串起来。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 420, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Image src="assets/ui_home.png" style={{ width: 400, height: 281, objectFit: 'contain' }} /><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>图：V1.5.0 首页概览（真实页面截图）</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 14 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 48, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>三条痛点共同指向一件事：学习上下文必须按课程被系统记住，而不是靠用户反复输入。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>09 / 22</Text></Box></Slide>